  m_text: 'Hello there, Zap. Welcome to the Khronos project. I am your personal testing
    administrator who will ensure your peak performance. Your task in these tests
    is simple: make your way to the other end of the chamber and enter the Elevator
    to complete the portion of the test. During these tests, you will be required
    to implement various locomotive techniques to reach the end of the chamber, but
    we must calibrate your motor controls first. Your compliance will be rewarded,
    and excellence is expected of you. We will begin by calibrating your jumping
    capabilities. When the door opens, you may begin testing. The door will open
    in 3, 2, 1.'
