  subs: {fileID: 0}
  canvasGroup: {fileID: 0}
  Tutorial1Start:
  - time: 0
    text: Hello there, Zap. Welcome to the Khronos project. I am your personal testing
      administrator who will ensure your peak performance.
  - time: 7.25
    text: 'Your task in these tests is simple: make your way to the other end of
      the chamber and enter the Elevator to complete the portion of the test.'
  - time: 14.75
    text: During these tests, you will be required to implement various locomotive
      techniques to reach the end of the chamber, but we must calibrate your motor
      controls first.
  - time: 23.5
    text: Your compliance will be rewarded, and excellence is expected of you. We
      will begin by calibrating your jumping capabilities.
  - time: 31
    text: When the door opens, you may begin the test. The door will open in 3, 2,
      1.
  Tutorial1End:
  - time: 0
    text: 'Initial Calibration Complete. Congratulations, Zap. Continue towards the
      elevator to continue to the next test. '
  Tutorial2Start:
  - time: 0
    text: This next test is designed to calibrate Energy Transference from your legs
      into sliding.
  - time: 4.6
    text: To complete this test, you will be required to traverse under certain elements
      of the chamber that are much too short for you to stand under.
  - time: 11
    text: "I\u2019d wish you luck, but you don\u2019t need it."
  Tutorial2End:
  - time: 0
    text: "Sliding Functionality confirmed. You are displaying great skill thus far,
      Zap. Let\u2019s hope you keep providing in these next tests."
  - time: 6.8
    text: Continue into the elevator when you are ready.
  Tutorial3Start:
  - time: 0
    text: The next test you will perform will test the Mag-Lok technology interwoven
      into your suit.
  - time: 4.2
    text: This will let you maintain horizontal momentum while suspended from the
      ground, so long as you remain close to a wall.
  - time: 10.4
    text: You might have also noticed the electrified floor throughout the chamber.
  - time: 14.4
    text: Do not be alarmed. You will not come to harm should you come into contact
      with them,
  - time: 19.2
    text: but it will force us to reset the chamber to retry the test. Do your best
      to stay out of the electrified floor as much as you can.
  Tutorial3End:
  - time: 0
    text: Mag-Lok synchronization tested and completed. This concludes with the Locomotive
      portion of the test,
  - time: 5.3
    text: but we are not done here. Continue to the Elevator to begin the cognitive
      portion of the test.
  Tutorial4Start:
  - time: 0
    text: This is the cognitive test. Tokens have been hidden throughout the environment.
  - time: 3.7
    text: Obtain all tokens, and the door to exit the chamber will open. Have at
      it, Zap.
  Tutorial4End:
  - time: 0
    text: Cognitive test complete. Congratulations on finishing all preliminary tests.
  - time: 4.6
    text: There is one more test available for you, now that your locomotive and
      cognitive faculties have been assessed and verified.
  - time: 11
    text: Proceed to the elevator to begin briefing on the Gauntlet.
